### LAYER 2 — Command & Event Core (NEW — CENTRAL)

> *"Everything flows through commands and events. This is the spine."*

```mermaid
graph LR
    classDef cmd fill:#e8eaf6,stroke:#283593,stroke-width:2px
    classDef evt fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#c2185b,stroke-width:2px

    REQ["HTTP/WS Request"] --> CMD["Command Handler"]:::cmd
    CMD --> |"validates + authorizes"| AUTH["Auth + RBAC"]
    CMD --> |"executes"| BIZ["Business Logic\n(VCS / Retrieval)"]
    BIZ --> |"emits"| EVT["Event Bus"]:::evt
    EVT --> |"persists"| STORE["gitmem_events"]
    EVT --> |"async"| WORKERS["Job Workers"]
    EVT --> |"realtime"| WS["WebSocket Push"]
    EVT --> |"log"| REFLOG["RefLog"]
```

**Event Store Table** — `gitmem_events`:
```sql
CREATE TABLE gitmem_events (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    workspace_id TEXT NOT NULL,
    event_type TEXT NOT NULL,   -- MEMORY_CREATED, COMMIT_CREATED, BRANCH_CREATED, etc.
    actor_id TEXT NOT NULL,     -- user_id or agent_id
    entity_type TEXT NOT NULL,  -- memory, commit, branch, repo
    entity_id TEXT NOT NULL,
    payload JSONB DEFAULT '{}',
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now()
);
CREATE INDEX idx_events_workspace ON gitmem_events(workspace_id, created_at DESC);
CREATE INDEX idx_events_type ON gitmem_events(event_type, created_at DESC);
```

**Event Types**:
`MEMORY_CREATED`, `MEMORY_UPDATED`, `MEMORY_DELETED`, `COMMIT_CREATED`, `BRANCH_CREATED`, `BRANCH_DELETED`, `MERGE_COMPLETED`, `CHERRY_PICK_COMPLETED`, `COLLAB_ADDED`, `COLLAB_REMOVED`, `REPO_FORKED`, `ROLLBACK_EXECUTED`, `COMPACTION_RUN`

