**Workspace Model**:
```python
class Workspace(BaseModel):
    workspace_id: str
    name: str
    slug: str                    # URL-friendly name
    owner_id: str                # user_id of creator
    plan: Literal["free", "pro", "enterprise"] = "free"
    created_at: datetime
    settings: dict = {}
```

**Supabase Table** — `gitmem_workspaces`:
```sql
CREATE TABLE gitmem_workspaces (
    workspace_id TEXT PRIMARY KEY,
    name TEXT NOT NULL,
    slug TEXT UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    owner_id TEXT NOT NULL,
    plan TEXT DEFAULT 'free',
    settings JSONB DEFAULT '{}',
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now()
);
```

**Membership Table** — `gitmem_workspace_members`:
```sql
CREATE TABLE gitmem_workspace_members (
    workspace_id TEXT REFERENCES gitmem_workspaces(workspace_id),
    user_id TEXT NOT NULL,
    role TEXT DEFAULT 'member',   -- owner, admin, member, viewer
    joined_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now(),
    PRIMARY KEY (workspace_id, user_id)
);
```

**Hierarchy**:
```
Workspace
  ├── Members (users with roles)
  ├── Repos (agent memory repositories)
  │     ├── Branches
  │     ├── Commits
  │     └── Memories
  ├── Plan & Quotas
  └── Settings
```

