### LAYER 5 — Ingestion

Same as before, but **all heavy work goes through the Job Queue**:

| Operation | Sync/Async | Why |
|---|---|---|
| Memory creation (metadata) | **Sync** | Fast Supabase insert |
| Embedding generation | **Async (Job)** | Slow API call |
| Large file ingestion | **Async (Job)** | Could take minutes |
| Summarization | **Async (Job)** | LLM call |
| Repo re-indexing | **Async (Job)** | Full vector rebuild |
| Snapshot compaction | **Async (Job)** | Heavy DAG walk |
| Garbage collection | **Async (Job)** | Scan + delete |

