### INFRA — Background Job System (NEW)

```
core/jobs/
    ├── queue.py           # Job queue interface
    ├── workers.py         # Worker pool
    └── retry_manager.py   # Retry + dead letter
```

**v2.0 Implementation**: Simple Supabase-backed queue (no Redis/Celery yet):

```sql
CREATE TABLE gitmem_jobs (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    workspace_id TEXT NOT NULL,
    job_type TEXT NOT NULL,        -- embed, summarize, compact, gc, reindex
    payload JSONB NOT NULL,
    status TEXT DEFAULT 'pending', -- pending, running, completed, failed, dead
    attempts INT DEFAULT 0,
    max_attempts INT DEFAULT 3,
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now(),
    started_at TIMESTAMPTZ,
    completed_at TIMESTAMPTZ,
    error TEXT
);
CREATE INDEX idx_jobs_pending ON gitmem_jobs(status, created_at) WHERE status = 'pending';
```

Workers poll this table. Simple, cloud-native, no Redis needed for v2.

