| `gitmem_reflog` | L4 | Ref change audit trail |
| `gitmem_events` | L2 | Immutable event log |
| `gitmem_jobs` | Infra | Background job queue |
| `gitmem_repo_meta` | L3 | Repository settings & quotas |

| Storage Bucket | Layer | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `gitmem-objects` | L4 | SHA-addressed compressed blobs |

| ChromaDB Collection | Layer | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `gitmem_global` | L6 | Global vector index |
| `{agent_id}` | L6 | Per-agent vectors |

