## Development Phases (Middle-Out)

### Phase 1 — Core Data Model
Build all Supabase tables + Pydantic models:
- Workspaces, members, repos, branches, commits, objects, memories, events, jobs

### Phase 2 — VCS Engine (Pure Backend)
- Object Store → Supabase Buckets
- Commit, checkout, branch, merge (with policies), diff, rollback, cherry-pick
- RefLog, compaction, cache
- No UI.

### Phase 3 — Retrieval Pipeline (The Moat)
- Semantic + recency + importance + episodic + graph retrieval
- Reranker, token packer, summarizer
- Ingestion pipeline (chunker, embedder, classifier)

### Phase 4 — Collaboration & Access
- Workspace management
- RBAC, quotas, scope enforcement
- Collaborator invites, user search

### Phase 5 — MCP Integration
- Only after APIs stabilize

### Phase 6 — GUI
- Last. APIs change, models change, workflows change.
- Building UI too early causes constant rewrites.

